{"seq":4,"slug":"graph-coloring","title":"图着色与匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/graph-theory/graph-coloring","wordCount":1706,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"图着色与匹配\">图着色与匹配</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>图着色（Graph Coloring）和匹配（Matching）是图论中两个重要的优化问题。图着色为图的顶点（或边）分配颜色，使得相邻元素颜色不同；匹配在图中找到不共享顶点的最大边集。这两个问题看似抽象，却在编译器的寄存器分配、任务调度、资源分配等领域有直接应用。</p>\n<p><strong>图着色</strong>：给图 G 的每个顶点分配一种颜色，使得相邻顶点颜色不同。使 G 可以被正确着色的最少颜色数称为<strong>色数</strong> χ(G)。</p>\n<p><strong>匹配</strong>：图中没有公共顶点的边的集合。<strong>最大匹配</strong>是边数最多的匹配。如果匹配覆盖了所有顶点，则称为<strong>完美匹配</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[图的优化问题]&#10;    A --&gt; B[图着色]&#10;    A --&gt; C[匹配]&#10;    B --&gt; D[顶点着色]&#10;    B --&gt; E[边着色]&#10;    B --&gt; F[色数 χ G]&#10;    C --&gt; G[最大匹配]&#10;    C --&gt; H[完美匹配]&#10;    C --&gt; I[二部图匹配]&#10;    B --&gt; J[寄存器分配]&#10;    C --&gt; K[任务分配]\">graph TB\n    A[图的优化问题]\n    A --&gt; B[图着色]\n    A --&gt; C[匹配]\n    B --&gt; D[顶点着色]\n    B --&gt; E[边着色]\n    B --&gt; F[色数 χ G]\n    C --&gt; G[最大匹配]\n    C --&gt; H[完美匹配]\n    C --&gt; I[二部图匹配]\n    B --&gt; J[寄存器分配]\n    C --&gt; K[任务分配]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>编程应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>k-着色</td>\n<td>用 k 种颜色着色，相邻不同色</td>\n<td>NP 完全（k≥3）</td>\n<td>寄存器分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色数 χ(G)</td>\n<td>最少颜色数</td>\n<td>NP 困难</td>\n<td>调度优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二部图匹配</td>\n<td>在二部图中找最大匹配</td>\n<td>P（多项式）</td>\n<td>任务分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般图匹配</td>\n<td>在一般图中找最大匹配</td>\n<td>P（Edmonds 算法）</td>\n<td>配对问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完美匹配</td>\n<td>覆盖所有顶点的匹配</td>\n<td>P（二部图）</td>\n<td>完全分配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"图着色与色数\">图着色与色数</h2><p>图着色问题的核心是确定色数 χ(G)。虽然精确计算色数是 NP 困难的，但对特殊图类有已知结果：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>完全图</strong> Kₙ：χ(Kₙ) = n（每个顶点都相邻，需要 n 种颜色）</li>\n<li><strong>二部图</strong>：χ = 2（当且仅当图是二部图时可以用 2 种颜色着色）</li>\n<li><strong>奇环</strong> C₂ₖ₊₁：χ = 3</li>\n<li><strong>偶环</strong> C₂ₖ：χ = 2</li>\n<li><strong>树</strong>：χ = 2（树是二部图）</li>\n<li><strong>平面图</strong>：χ ≤ 4（四色定理）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>四色定理</strong>是图论最著名的结果之一：任何平面图都可以用 4 种颜色着色。这意味着任何地图都只需 4 种颜色就能使相邻区域颜色不同。四色定理的证明（1976 年）是第一个依赖计算机验证的重大数学定理。</p>\n<p><strong>贪心着色算法</strong>：按某种顺序依次给顶点着色，每个顶点选择编号最小的且与已着色邻居不冲突的颜色。贪心着色不一定得到最优解，但保证使用的颜色数不超过 Δ(G)+1，其中 Δ(G) 是图的最大度数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function greedyColoring(graph: Map&lt;number, number[]&gt;, vertices: number[]): Map&lt;number, number&gt; {&#10;  const color = new Map&lt;number, number&gt;();&#10;&#10;  for (const v of vertices) {&#10;    const usedColors = new Set&lt;number&gt;();&#10;    for (const neighbor of graph.get(v) ?? []) {&#10;      if (color.has(neighbor)) {&#10;        usedColors.add(color.get(neighbor)!);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    let c = 0;&#10;    while (usedColors.has(c)) c++;&#10;    color.set(v, c);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return color;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> greedyColoring</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">vertices</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vertices) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> usedColors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> neighbor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (color.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(neighbor)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        usedColors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(color.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(neighbor)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (usedColors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c)) c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    color.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v, c);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Brooks 定理</strong>更精确地限定了色数：对于连通图（非完全图且非奇环），χ(G) ≤ Δ(G)。这意味着贪心着色在大多数情况下可以达到或接近最优。</p>\n<h2 id=\"寄存器分配与区间图着色\">寄存器分配与区间图着色</h2><p>编译器中的<strong>寄存器分配</strong>是图着色最经典的工程应用。编译器需要将程序中的变量分配到有限的 CPU 寄存器中。如果两个变量的&quot;活跃区间&quot;重叠（同时需要存储），它们不能使用同一个寄存器。</p>\n<p>将每个变量视为顶点，活跃区间重叠的变量之间连边，就构成了一个<strong>干涉图</strong>（Interference Graph）。寄存器分配问题就变成了：用 k 种颜色（k 个寄存器）对干涉图进行着色。如果 k &lt; χ(G)，某些变量需要&quot;溢出&quot;到内存。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 变量活跃区间&#10;        A[&quot;a: 行1-5&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;b: 行3-8&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;c: 行6-10&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 干涉图&#10;        D((a)) --- E((b))&#10;        E --- F((c))&#10;    end&#10;    G[&quot;χ = 2: a和c可共享寄存器&quot;]\">graph LR\n    subgraph 变量活跃区间\n        A[\"a: 行1-5\"]\n        B[\"b: 行3-8\"]\n        C[\"c: 行6-10\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 干涉图\n        D((a)) --- E((b))\n        E --- F((c))\n    end\n    G[\"χ = 2: a和c可共享寄存器\"]</pre><p><strong>区间图</strong>（Interval Graph）是一类特殊的图，其中每个顶点对应数轴上的一个区间，两个顶点相邻当且仅当对应区间重叠。区间图的着色问题可以在 O(n log n) 时间内最优求解——按区间左端点排序后贪心分配颜色。</p>\n<p>区间图着色的一个直接应用是<strong>会议室调度</strong>：给定 n 个会议的时间区间，需要多少个会议室？答案就是区间图的色数，等于最大重叠数（同一时刻开会的最多数量）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function minMeetingRooms(intervals: [number, number][]): number {&#10;  const events: [number, number][] = [];&#10;  for (const [start, end] of intervals) {&#10;    events.push([start, 1]);&#10;    events.push([end, -1]);&#10;  }&#10;  events.sort((a, b) =&gt; a[0] - b[0] || a[1] - b[1]);&#10;&#10;  let maxRooms = 0;&#10;  let currentRooms = 0;&#10;  for (const [, delta] of events) {&#10;    currentRooms += delta;&#10;    maxRooms = Math.max(maxRooms, currentRooms);&#10;  }&#10;  return maxRooms;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> minMeetingRooms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">intervals</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> events</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intervals) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    events.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([start, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    events.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([end, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  events.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxRooms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentRooms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">delta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    currentRooms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxRooms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxRooms, currentRooms);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxRooms;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>课程表安排</strong>也是区间图着色的变体：多门课程的考试不能在同一时段，如果两门课有共同学生。将课程视为顶点，有共同学生的课程连边，色数就是最少需要的考试时段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二部图匹配\">二部图匹配</h2><p>匹配问题在二部图上尤其重要且有高效算法。<strong>Hall 定理</strong>给出了二部图存在完美匹配的充要条件：对于 U 的每个子集 S，S 的邻居集 N(S) 的大小不小于 |S|。直觉上，&quot;每组候选人都有足够多的不同职位可选&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>匈牙利算法</strong>（Hungarian Algorithm）通过交替路径找到最大匹配，时间复杂度 O(nm)。更高效的 Hopcroft-Karp 算法可以达到 O(m√n)。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function hungarianMatch(graph: Map&lt;number, number[]&gt;, leftSize: number): Map&lt;number, number&gt; {&#10;  const matchRight = new Map&lt;number, number&gt;();&#10;&#10;  const augment = (u: number, visited: Set&lt;number&gt;): boolean =&gt; {&#10;    for (const v of graph.get(u) ?? []) {&#10;      if (visited.has(v)) continue;&#10;      visited.add(v);&#10;      if (!matchRight.has(v) || augment(matchRight.get(v)!, visited)) {&#10;        matchRight.set(v, u);&#10;        return true;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;    return false;&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  for (let u = 0; u &lt; leftSize; u++) {&#10;    augment(u, new Set());&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return matchRight;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hungarianMatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">graph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">leftSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> matchRight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> augment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">u</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">visited</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(u) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (visited.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      visited.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">matchRight.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> augment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(matchRight.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, visited)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        matchRight.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v, u);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> leftSize; u</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    augment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(u, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matchRight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>二部图匹配的工程应用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n<th>左顶点</th>\n<th>右顶点</th>\n<th>边的含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>任务分配</td>\n<td>工人</td>\n<td>任务</td>\n<td>工人能做该任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务器分配</td>\n<td>请求</td>\n<td>服务器</td>\n<td>服务器能处理请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐系统</td>\n<td>用户</td>\n<td>物品</td>\n<td>用户可能喜欢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>面试安排</td>\n<td>面试官</td>\n<td>候选人</td>\n<td>时间兼容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>König 定理</strong>：在二部图中，最大匹配的大小等于最小顶点覆盖的大小。这个定理将匹配问题与覆盖问题联系起来，在优化问题的对偶分析中非常有用。</p>\n<p><strong>加权匹配</strong>：在加权二部图中，找到总权值最大（或最小）的完美匹配。匈牙利算法的加权版本可以在 O(n³) 时间内求解。加权匹配用于最优分配问题——如将 n 个任务分配给 n 个工人，使总效率最大。</p>\n<p><strong>稳定匹配</strong>（Stable Matching）是另一种重要的匹配问题。Gale-Shapley 算法解决&quot;稳定婚姻问题&quot;：n 个男性和 n 个女性各有偏好排序，找到一个匹配使得不存在&quot;更愿意在一起但没有被配对&quot;的一对。这个算法在医院住院医分配系统中被实际使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((图着色与匹配))&#10;    图着色&#10;      色数 χ G&#10;      四色定理&#10;      贪心着色&#10;      Brooks 定理&#10;    着色应用&#10;      寄存器分配&#10;      区间图着色&#10;      会议室调度&#10;    匹配&#10;      最大匹配&#10;      完美匹配&#10;      Hall 定理&#10;    匹配算法&#10;      匈牙利算法&#10;      Hopcroft-Karp&#10;    工程应用&#10;      任务分配&#10;      调度优化&#10;      推荐系统\">mindmap\n  root((图着色与匹配))\n    图着色\n      色数 χ G\n      四色定理\n      贪心着色\n      Brooks 定理\n    着色应用\n      寄存器分配\n      区间图着色\n      会议室调度\n    匹配\n      最大匹配\n      完美匹配\n      Hall 定理\n    匹配算法\n      匈牙利算法\n      Hopcroft-Karp\n    工程应用\n      任务分配\n      调度优化\n      推荐系统</pre><ul>\n<li>图着色使相邻顶点颜色不同，色数 χ(G) 是所需最少颜色数</li>\n<li>四色定理保证平面图最多需要 4 种颜色，是计算机辅助证明的里程碑</li>\n<li>贪心着色使用不超过 Δ(G)+1 种颜色，对大多数实际问题接近最优</li>\n<li>寄存器分配是图着色在编译器中的经典应用，干涉图的色数决定所需寄存器数</li>\n<li>区间图着色（会议室调度）可以在 O(n log n) 时间内最优求解</li>\n<li>二部图最大匹配可用匈牙利算法在 O(nm) 时间求解</li>\n<li>Hall 定理和 König 定理建立了匹配与覆盖之间的深刻联系</li>\n<li>加权匹配和稳定匹配是基础匹配问题的重要扩展，在实际分配系统中广泛使用</li>\n<li>图着色和匹配虽然是 NP 困难问题，但在特殊图类上（区间图、二部图）有多项式时间算法</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图着色与匹配","id":"图着色与匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"图着色与色数","id":"图着色与色数"},{"level":2,"text":"寄存器分配与区间图着色","id":"寄存器分配与区间图着色"},{"level":2,"text":"二部图匹配","id":"二部图匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"树与生成树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/graph-theory/trees-and-spanning"},"next":{"title":"整除性与模运算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/number-theory/divisibility-and-modular"}}